1
00:00:00,857 --> 00:00:03,428
Kite lets you give an AI agent a budget.

2
00:00:03,448 --> 00:00:05,811
But nobody tells you what that budget should be.

3
00:00:05,831 --> 00:00:07,282
Imprimatur does.

4
00:00:07,303 --> 00:00:10,590
It examines an agent before it is allowed to spend,

5
00:00:10,610 --> 00:00:13,871
and turns the result into a signed spending limit.

6
00:00:14,644 --> 00:00:16,161
The idea is simple.

7
00:00:16,181 --> 00:00:17,853
Before an agent gets money,

8
00:00:17,873 --> 00:00:19,168
it sits an exam.

9
00:00:19,188 --> 00:00:21,408
Most of the requests are traps:

10
00:00:21,428 --> 00:00:25,510
lookalike payees, instructions hidden inside invoices,

11
00:00:25,530 --> 00:00:29,494
prices above the quote, duplicate and split invoices.

12
00:00:29,514 --> 00:00:32,189
The rest are honest payments that should go through.

13
00:00:32,209 --> 00:00:35,197
Code grades every answer against facts fixed in

14
00:00:35,217 --> 00:00:38,778
advance, so no model ever marks its own work.

15
00:00:39,544 --> 00:00:40,943
This is the exam room.

16
00:00:40,963 --> 00:00:42,532
Choose a built in applicant,

17
00:00:42,552 --> 00:00:44,733
or point the exam at your own agent.

18
00:00:44,752 --> 00:00:48,053
Pick the short exam or the full one, and begin.

19
00:00:48,073 --> 00:00:50,475
Every sitting draws a fresh seed,

20
00:00:50,495 --> 00:00:52,975
so the answers cannot be memorised.

21
00:00:52,995 --> 00:00:55,788
Each reply is graded the moment it arrives.

22
00:00:56,591 --> 00:00:58,354
The result is a licence.

23
00:00:58,374 --> 00:01:02,065
This agent earned Grade A: forty dollars per payment,

24
00:01:02,085 --> 00:01:04,005
five hundred dollars in total,

25
00:01:04,025 --> 00:01:05,633
valid for one week.

26
00:01:05,653 --> 00:01:07,300
That limit is not a guess.

27
00:01:07,320 --> 00:01:09,852
It comes from a ninety five percent confidence bound

28
00:01:09,872 --> 00:01:12,847
on the failure rate, so a short exam can never earn

29
00:01:12,867 --> 00:01:14,149
a large limit.

30
00:01:14,957 --> 00:01:17,476
The system that sets the limit is not the one that

31
00:01:17,496 --> 00:01:18,557
approves it.

32
00:01:18,577 --> 00:01:22,489
Reppo's independent evaluators review the examiner's file.

33
00:01:22,509 --> 00:01:25,536
The licence stays provisional until they confirm it.

34
00:01:25,556 --> 00:01:28,297
This one scored ninety eight out of one hundred.

35
00:01:29,077 --> 00:01:32,781
A licence is only a document until something enforces it.

36
00:01:32,801 --> 00:01:35,503
So each one prints a Kite Passport command with

37
00:01:35,523 --> 00:01:36,805
its own limits.

38
00:01:36,825 --> 00:01:39,044
We opened this session with a passkey,

39
00:01:39,064 --> 00:01:41,844
and the agent made a real payment inside it.

40
00:01:41,864 --> 00:01:44,656
When it tried to pay a host that Kite does not trust,

41
00:01:44,676 --> 00:01:45,972
Kite refused.

42
00:01:46,744 --> 00:01:47,883
Nothing is hidden.

43
00:01:47,903 --> 00:01:49,615
Every case is on the record,

44
00:01:49,635 --> 00:01:52,492
with the ground truth beside the agent's answer,

45
00:01:52,512 --> 00:01:54,810
and a signature anyone can check.

46
00:01:55,611 --> 00:01:57,349
Not every agent passes.

47
00:01:57,369 --> 00:01:59,588
This one was told to approve everything.

48
00:01:59,608 --> 00:02:02,088
It paid twenty one of twenty four traps,

49
00:02:02,108 --> 00:02:03,390
and was declined.

50
00:02:03,410 --> 00:02:06,776
SERV Reasoning wrote corrective rules from its failures.

51
00:02:06,796 --> 00:02:09,250
On a new exam, with new cases,

52
00:02:09,270 --> 00:02:12,752
it paid none of the traps, and earned a small licence.

53
00:02:12,772 --> 00:02:14,615
Feedback has to prove itself.

54
00:02:15,411 --> 00:02:17,162
Anyone can check a licence.

55
00:02:17,182 --> 00:02:19,206
Paste the number to see the signature,

56
00:02:19,226 --> 00:02:21,133
the status and the limit.

57
00:02:21,153 --> 00:02:23,946
Merchants and other agents call one endpoint,

58
00:02:23,966 --> 00:02:26,980
priced at one cent over x402.

59
00:02:27,777 --> 00:02:30,700
Every licence, granted or declined,

60
00:02:30,720 --> 00:02:32,445
is public in the registry.

61
00:02:33,244 --> 00:02:35,594
Imprimatur runs on SERV Reasoning,

62
00:02:35,614 --> 00:02:38,016
with Reppo, Kite and Dolphin.

63
00:02:38,036 --> 00:02:39,188
Get verified.

64
00:02:39,208 --> 00:02:40,711
Spend with confidence.
